{"id":"1b619488086561ea","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-gl-decidability.md","title":"GL Decidability","display":"thm-gl-decidability — GL Decidability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-gl-decidability","aliases":["89-thm-gl-decidability"],"display":"thm-gl-decidability — GL Decidability","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-decidability]]","[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","[[89-thm-gl-decidable]]","[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]","[[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-gl-decidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-gl-decidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-decidability — GL Decidability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"128a3cd6545693f6\" href=\"?note=128a3cd6545693f6\" title=\"89-df-gl-decidability\">89-df-gl-decidability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3bbdf6f3419b5805\" href=\"?note=3bbdf6f3419b5805\" title=\"89-df-gl-algorithm\">89-df-gl-algorithm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f0380129bd9e48f3\" href=\"?note=f0380129bd9e48f3\" title=\"89-thm-gl-decidable\">89-thm-gl-decidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ff66b5cf43748aff\" href=\"?note=ff66b5cf43748aff\" title=\"89-df-modal-godel-code\">89-df-modal-godel-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b560939370c68b68\" href=\"?note=b560939370c68b68\" title=\"89-lem-gl-proof-closure\">89-lem-gl-proof-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> is the predicate from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"128a3cd6545693f6\" href=\"?note=128a3cd6545693f6\" title=\"89-df-gl-decidability\">89-df-gl-decidability</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li>GL具有有限模型性质 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cf7dbabb97c0679f\" href=\"?note=cf7dbabb97c0679f\" title=\"89-df-finite-model-property\">89-df-finite-model-property</a>)</li>\n<li>GL是可判定的模态逻辑</li>\n<li>重要于可证性逻辑的应用</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f0380129bd9e48f3\" href=\"?note=f0380129bd9e48f3\" title=\"89-thm-gl-decidable\">89-thm-gl-decidable</a> 给出总的特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span>；据\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"128a3cd6545693f6\" href=\"?note=128a3cd6545693f6\" title=\"89-df-gl-decidability\">89-df-gl-decidability</a> 取专用模态编码。对任意自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，先计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(n)\\)</span>；非法码输出 0，合法码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\\)</span>。两个程序都终止，且 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b560939370c68b68\" href=\"?note=b560939370c68b68\" title=\"89-lem-gl-proof-closure\">89-lem-gl-proof-closure</a> 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}=\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}=\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>，所以这个全域程序恰是定理码集的特征函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"128a3cd6545693f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-decidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-algorithm","status":"resolved","id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-decidable","status":"resolved","id":"f0380129bd9e48f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-decidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-godel-code","status":"resolved","id":"ff66b5cf43748aff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-proof-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b560939370c68b68","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"128a3cd6545693f6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}$ is the predicate from\n[[89-df-gl-decidability]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}$ : GL逻辑 (see [[89-df-gl-logic]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fini